# Penalti: Football Quiz — Support

Thanks for playing Penalti! If something isn't working or you have an idea, email **zachristudio@gmail.com**. We read every message and usually reply within two working days.

To help us fix a problem quickly, please include:

- your iPhone model and iOS version (Settings → General → About),
- the app version (Penalti → Settings, at the bottom),
- what happened and what you expected, and a screenshot if you can.

## Common questions

**When do tonight's five penalties change?**
Every day at midnight, your local time. Everyone in the world gets the same five players, so you can compare scores with friends.

**How does scoring work?**
A goal is worth 400 points on the first clue, then 300, 200 and 100 as more clues appear. Shoot early for more points. Scoring on the very first clue is a Panenka.

**What is Free play?**
Unlimited penalties until you miss three times. On your third miss you can go in goal for one save ("Save it!") or retake the penalty after a short, optional ad.

**How do I unlock kits, boots, balls and stadiums?**
Score points to earn XP and level up. Each level unlocks a reward; put them on in the Locker. Everything you can unlock is cosmetic: it doesn't change how the game plays.

**There's no sound.**
Check that Sound is on in Penalti → Settings. If your iPhone's ring/silent switch is on silent, turn on "Play on silent" in Penalti's Settings.

**I don't want personalised ads / I want to change my ad choices.**
In the EEA, UK and Switzerland: Penalti → Settings → Ad privacy choices. Everywhere: iOS Settings → Privacy & Security → Tracking.

**I don't want to share usage statistics.**
Penalti → Settings → Share usage data → off.

**Will I lose my progress if I delete the app?**
Yes. Your progress is stored only on your iPhone; we don't have accounts or a copy of it.

